cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Wavelet Synthesizer"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Guyot"
    given-names: "Pierre Arnaud"
    alias: "OktoPierre"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23431760
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.23431760
    description: "Zenodo record of the code: https://zenodo.org/records/23431760"
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.23431759
    description: "All versions (Zenodo concept DOI)"
repository-code: "https://github.com/PierreArnaudGUYOT/Free-Wavelet-Synthesizer-VST"
url: "https://pierrearnaudguyot.github.io/Free-Wavelet-Synthesizer-VST/"
version: "beta 0.3"
date-released: "2026-10-17"
abstract: >-
  A polyphonic synthesizer that shapes sound with the discrete wavelet transform instead of Fourier filters: one cycle
  of each tone is decomposed into 11 octave-spaced wavelet bands and resynthesised band by band. Engine A (wavelet
  subtractive) filters and thins out the atoms of a source wave; engine B (wavelet additive) writes the atoms directly.
  Web application and VST3 / VST2 instrument for Windows x64.
keywords:
  - sound synthesis
  - discrete wavelet transform
  - synthesizer
  - VST3
  - Web Audio
